          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.plan.note.rootOnly" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "`clean` lists this for accounting and never deletes it; it needs root with Full Disk Access — the app's privileged helper (experimental)."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "`clean` lo muestra solo para contabilizarlo y nunca lo borra; hace falta root con Acceso total al disco: el asistente privilegiado de la app (experimental)."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "`clean` はこれを集計のために表示するだけで、削除はしません。削除にはフルディスクアクセスを持つ root、つまりアプリの特権ヘルパー（実験的）が必要です。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "O `clean` lista isto só para contabilizar e nunca o apaga; é preciso root com Acesso Total ao Disco — o auxiliar privilegiado do app (experimental)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "`clean` 只为统计列出此项，从不删除；删除需要具有“完全磁盘访问权限”的 root，即应用的特权辅助程序（实验性）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.plan.note.runtimeSizes" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The size shown counts only the MobileAsset store; `xcodevaultctl runtime list` shows each runtime's real size."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "El tamaño mostrado cuenta solo el almacén MobileAsset; `xcodevaultctl runtime list` muestra el tamaño real de cada runtime."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "表示されるサイズは MobileAsset ストアの分だけです。各ランタイムの実際のサイズは `xcodevaultctl runtime list` で確認できます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "O tamanho mostrado conta só o armazenamento MobileAsset; `xcodevaultctl runtime list` mostra o tamanho real de cada runtime."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "显示的大小只计算 MobileAsset 存储；`xcodevaultctl runtime list` 会显示每个运行时的实际大小。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.plan.note.simctlDelete" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Shut the device down first; its apps and their data are deleted."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Apaga primero el dispositivo; sus apps y sus datos se eliminan."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "先にデバイスをシャットダウンしてください。アプリとそのデータは削除されます。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Desligue o dispositivo primeiro; seus apps e os dados deles são apagados."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "请先关闭该设备；其中的应用及其数据会被删除。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "cli.root.discussion" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Read commands (scan, status, plan, report, doctor, xcode, runtime list, volumes, journal, compatibility, permissions) are always safe and never change anything. Every read command supports --json.\n\nStrategies marked \"(exp.)\" / experimental have not met the Definition of Done in docs/product/NON_GOALS_AND_SAFETY.md for your macOS/Xcode combination.\n\nExperiment IDs that appear in help text (E2, E8b, E11 …) are defined in docs/architecture/EXPERIMENTS.md.\n\nLanguage: --lang <code> (%@) or XCODEVAULT_LANG; otherwise your macOS language. --json output and report are never translated."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Los comandos de lectura (scan, status, plan, report, doctor, xcode, runtime list, volumes, journal, compatibility, permissions) son siempre seguros y nunca cambian nada. Todos los comandos de lectura admiten --json.\n\nLas estrategias marcadas con \"(exp.)\" / experimental aún no cumplen la Definición de Hecho de docs/product/NON_GOALS_AND_SAFETY.md para tu combinación de macOS/Xcode.\n\nLos ID de experimento que aparecen en la ayuda (E2, E8b, E11 …) se definen en docs/architecture/EXPERIMENTS.md.\n\nIdioma: --lang <código> (%@) o XCODEVAULT_LANG; si no, el idioma de tu macOS. La salida --json y report nunca se traducen."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "読み取りコマンド（scan、status、plan、report、doctor、xcode、runtime list、volumes、journal、compatibility、permissions）は常に安全で、何も変更しません。すべての読み取りコマンドは --json に対応しています。\n\n「(exp.)」または実験的と表示された方式は、お使いの macOS/Xcode の組み合わせで docs/product/NON_GOALS_AND_SAFETY.md の完了の定義をまだ満たしていません。\n\nヘルプに出てくる実験 ID（E2、E8b、E11 など）は docs/architecture/EXPERIMENTS.md で定義されています。\n\n言語: --lang <コード>（%@）または XCODEVAULT_LANG。指定がなければ macOS の言語を使います。--json の出力と report は翻訳されません。"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "Os comandos de leitura (scan, status, plan, report, doctor, xcode, runtime list, volumes, journal, compatibility, permissions) são sempre seguros e nunca alteram nada. Todo comando de leitura aceita --json.\n\nEstratégias marcadas com \"(exp.)\" / experimental ainda não atendem à Definição de Pronto em docs/product/NON_GOALS_AND_SAFETY.md para a sua combinação de macOS/Xcode.\n\nOs IDs de experimento que aparecem na ajuda (E2, E8b, E11 …) são definidos em docs/architecture/EXPERIMENTS.md.\n\nIdioma: --lang <código> (%@) ou XCODEVAULT_LANG; caso contrário, o idioma do seu macOS. A saída --json e o report nunca são traduzidos."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "needs_review",
            "value" : "读取命令（scan、status、plan、report、doctor、xcode、runtime list、volumes、journal、compatibility、permissions）始终安全，不会更改任何内容。所有读取命令都支持 --json。\n\n标记为“(exp.)”或实验性的方案，在你的 macOS/Xcode 组合上尚未达到 docs/product/NON_GOALS_AND_SAFETY.md 中的完成定义。\n\n帮助中出现的实验编号（E2、E8b、E11 等）定义于 docs/architecture/EXPERIMENTS.md。\n\n语言：--lang <代码>（%@）或 XCODEVAULT_LANG；否则使用 macOS 的语言。--json 输出和 report 从不翻译。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
